<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Updated version of one of the best jitter aim macros! Run undetected with minimal screen shake but suprisingly efficient recoil mitigation for most weapons in the game without sounding like a rapid fire macro.

To Use - Bind to the key of your liking and press the keybind in place of the shoot button or assign a modifier.
Resolution - 2560x1440
Sensitivity - 1.6 800dpi
FOV - 110</Description>
    <Comment>Enjoy!</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 2 ms
MoveR 2 -2
